{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready-Player-Go! is an open-world adventure set in an evacuated landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are completely broke and decide to go back home to retrieve a treasure hidden in the northern caves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as you arrive, you receive news from your friends: the bad news is that the entry to the caves is obstructed, but the good news is that you are now the only person in a city where the last Golden Card is yet to be found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Golden Card comes with a huge prize that can pay off all your debts. Now, you have the opportunity to get both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready-Player-Go! is an exploration-driven experience that tests your visual scanning, attention to detail and memory skills. There is no map to help you traverse the landscape and no path is given, only your skillfulness will lead the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LONELY MAN'S JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way across a deserted landscape. Explore the city and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/extras/ee3449a6666b3681c879bd6b35025faa.avif?t=1759809808\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A QUEST FOR RITCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest to find the treasure and the Golden Card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/extras/92c84ecde681ce317728f39e1e698a8e.avif?t=1759809808\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIT THE OPEN ROAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through vast planes using nothing but the landmarks as your compass, and the landscape as your map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/extras/f89a7127e3e2fb549c144a2cfa473d58.avif?t=1759809808\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRIVE MULTIPLE CARS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find up to five drivable cars, all with different characteristics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/extras/611ecd13ccadc22ccc75f8c8ddd9bcec.avif?t=1759809808\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4028890?t=1759809808","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/658c7ed221a6fa0187edd18a32d73da3c7befd19/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759809808","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/8334218f9d3d9e19012a18740f8e0119da8e5e64/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759809808","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/8334218f9d3d9e19012a18740f8e0119da8e5e64/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759809808","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready-Player-Go! is an open-world adventure set in an evacuated landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are completely broke and decide to go back home to retrieve a treasure hidden in the northern caves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As soon as you arrive, you receive news from your friends: the bad news is that the entry to the caves is obstructed, but the good news is that you are now the only person in a city where the last Golden Card is yet to be found. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Golden Card comes with a huge prize that can pay off all your debts. Now, you have the opportunity to get both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready-Player-Go! is an exploration-driven experience that tests your visual scanning, attention to detail and memory skills. There is no map to help you traverse the landscape and no path is given, only your skillfulness will lead the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LONELY MAN'S JOURNEY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way across a deserted landscape. Explore the city and its surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/extras/ee3449a6666b3681c879bd6b35025faa.avif?t=1759809808\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A QUEST FOR RITCHES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a quest to find the treasure and the Golden Card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4028890/extras/92c84ecde681ce317728f39e1e698a8e.avif?t=1759809808\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HIT THE OPEN ROAD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive through vast planes using nothing but the landmarks as your compass, and the landscape as your map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://sha